ariable or cached per application instance, since the configuration parameters (`app.secret_key`, `app.config[\\"SECRET_KEY_FALLBACKS\\"]`, `self.salt`, `self.key_derivation`, `self.digest_method`) remain constant for a given application instance.\\n\\n**Optimization Approach:**\\n\\nThe serializer instantiation could be optimized by:\\n1. Caching the serializer instance per application instance (e.g., using a weak reference dictionary keyed by application)\\n2. Storing the serializer as an instance variable and invalidating it only when secret keys change\\n3. Using lazy initialization with memoization to create the serializer once per app configuration\\n\\nThis would eliminate the repeated cryptographic setup overhead and improve performance under high-concurrency conditions."}' + '\n')
